`call-next`: text button align right. Ensure not full width. `.call-next` maybe appearance. Add `min-height:26px` for tap target? User wants mobile. Could make 32px high with border. Use:
```
.call-next{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 1px auto;min-height:28px;padding:0 2px;border-bottom:1px solid...}
```
28px small but acceptable? Better 36px. Card height. Use min-height 32. Tap target still smaller than 44, but next control. Could make full-width outline? That adds height. Use `#btnCallNext` as an inline small button but style width 100%?Maybe a full-width small ghost button with min-height 34, text uppercase. Could look good and touch. But card already has main button below. Maybe `NEXT` chip on right, 34 high. We'll use 34.

Scene button when disabled looks dim. Good.

