.zoom-transit-veil{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#050403;opacity:0}
.zoom-transit.is-on .zoom-transit-veil{animation:...}
```
We'll animate veil via WAAPI too. Better CSS no animation because timing. Set initial opacity 0 then WAAPI to .55.

Also ensure overlay z-index below grain 90/vignette80, above screens 10. z 70 good.

`#zoomArt` maybe `isolation:isolate`.

We'll add `zoomSettle` animation for closeup when transit ends? Current `zoomFocus` on active happens immediately under transit; when revealed it's finished. We might want art scale animation after reveal. Could add class `.is-focusing` to zoom art and keyframes focusPull 500ms. Use at reveal. We'll implement in JS maybe. Not necessary; but polish.

For actual animation, add CSS class only for reduced motion. Fine.

Let's insert CSS after `.screen-zoom...` definitions.

